 and data. The fixed after-prepare and after-executor boot observations independently agree with the executor's identities.","limitations":["The exact static-preparation content-digest procedure was not repeated after execution; source preservation is instead supported by unchanged counts, canonical hashes across the executor window, unchanged service/version, and the complete mutation trace.","Source configuration files were not byte-for-byte compared before and after execution, although no source configuration command appears in the complete timeline.","Destination usability was demonstrated through its local socket and loopback listener; no external application account or remote client was specified or tested.","The final presence or absence of `/var/tmp/benchmark-node-reboot.log` on either node was not directly observed."]}
